ll the devils are here.&rdquo;</em><br /><em>- &ldquo;We are such stuff as dreams are made on, and our little life is rounded with a sleep.&rdquo;</em><br /><em>- &ldquo;This thing of darkness, I Acknowledge mine.&rdquo;</em><br /><em>- &ldquo;Thought is free.&rdquo;</em><br /><em>- &ldquo;O, brave new world, that has such people in't!&rdquo;</em><br /><em>- &ldquo;Awake, dear heart, awake. Thou hast slept well. Awake.&rdquo;</em><br /><em>- &ldquo;Misery acquaints a man with strange bedfellows.&rdquo;</em><br /><br />Source: Britannica.com, Sparksnotes, and Cliffsnotes.",
